                                                "sense_id": "eaf12156-4612-39b7-8796-ba7a04dec956",
                                                "text": "[…] Hazel telling about how she liked a good woodpile, especially when she used to take in washing to earn a little extra. She needed a goodly pile to fuel her washtubs."
